sts that can demonstrate that the delivered system meets each specified( ) .', '["A. Security checks", "B. Safety checks", "C. Consistency checks", "D. Usability checks"]', 'C', '', 2022, 1, 'lightsoft.tech | 2022年 上半年 综合知识', NOW()),
